# ==============================================================================
# FASTFOOD ECOSYSTEM - ROOT ENVIRONMENT OVERVIEW & POINTERS
# ==============================================================================
# This is a monorepo consisting of:
#   1. backend-rust/ : High-Performance REST API (Axum + Tokio + SQLx TiDB)
#   2. user-client/  : Customer Online Ordering Web App (React + Vite + Tailwind)
#   3. admin-client/ : Store Management Portal (React + Vite + Tailwind)
#   4. database/     : MySQL 8.0 & TiDB Cloud schema.sql and seed.sql
# ==============================================================================
#
# Please configure each component in its respective folder:
#
#   1. Backend Rust:
#      cd backend-rust
#      cp .env.example .env
#      (Configure DATABASE_URL, BREVO_API_KEY, SEPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET, SEPAY_API_KEY, IMAGEKIT...)
#
#   2. User Client:
#      cd user-client
#      cp .env.example .env
#      (Configure VITE_API_URL, default: http://localhost:3000/api)
#
#   3. Admin Client:
#      cd admin-client
#      cp .env.example .env
#      (Configure VITE_API_URL, default: http://localhost:3000/api)
#
# ==============================================================================

